    "en": "Delhi, Nudiyā, Mahoba, Aṇahilapāṭaka, Dhārā, Devagiri, Dorasamudra, Anumakoṇḍa, Gaṅgaikoṇḍacoḻapuram and Madurai. Ghazni, the Ghurid capital, is outside India.",
